# **HI-TECH College — Document Management & Permission System**

The next module should provide a complete document management system for students, lecturers, administrators and every department. It should control how documents are created, uploaded, designed, reviewed, approved, signed, issued, shared, downloaded and archived.

The system should support official college documents with consistent branding, templates, document numbering, approval workflows and secure access.

